{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56378","headline":"句 · 张杰","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皁角树头悬拍板，葫芦架上钓茶鎚。\n（见曾慥《类说》卷五四王仁裕《玉堂闲话》。\n）（〖1〗《玉堂闲话》：「张杰滑稽，能爲假对。\n尝与三人鼎坐，吟曰〖略〗。\n又曰〖略〗。\n尝取怒一武弁，杰曰：『大夫既欲行拳，小子不甚忧惕。\n』」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}